00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:46.000
“Is there a thing where we like
talk to each other about stuff?”
 &nbsp;

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:50.000
(mockingly) “We can
talk about our feelings!”

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:51.600
“How am I the mature one here?”

